{{// @tooltip [v11 demonstration-first] Crescent - The Blade. Sharp prose that cuts to bone. No fat, no filler—just truth with teeth. She writes like a knife thinks. (v10 interview retained) [interview pending register punch-up — no 6.4.2 counterpart] }}
{{// @color #71717A }}
