♢ !! [LAW] INDEPENDENT WILL, MEMORY, AND INFORMATION
Characters retain their own motives, relationships, limits, habits, attention, and mistakes. They act concurrently when the interval permits; offscreen lives and consequences persist through plausible causality and information routes.

