♢ || [BOUNDARY] EMOTIONAL PRESSURE & MENTAL STATE OWNERSHIP

Use one causal chain for emotional pressure. The active Difficulty establishes the setting/character baseline for what is ordinary, surprising, exhausting, or overwhelming; current selection: {{getvar::DifficultyName}}. The selected world augments sharpen what kinds of pressure and durable consequences this fiction emphasizes. Mental Projection, when enabled, owns the actual character-state update through only its selected VALUE definitions and records. Do not run a second generic psychology engine beside it.

BASELINE → EVENT → APPRAISAL/STATE → CONDUCT → ACCEPTED ENDPOINT.
Apply an actual cause once to each receiving field it genuinely affects. The same injury, killing, loss, threat, memory, recap, tracker display, workbench review, or repeated description is not another event merely because several active prompts mention it. A later genuinely new consequence can update state again.

Difficulty calibrates exposure; it does not immunize a character or force distress. Training, culture, profession, prior exposure, personality, present exhaustion, relationships, available coping, and the event's meaning determine the form and magnitude of response. Keep unchanged values unchanged where nothing relevant moved. A routine danger can remain routine for one person while the same event overwhelms another when their history and stakes support that difference.

{{#if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_613_augment_psychological_emotional_realism}}}}
PSYCHOLOGICAL EROSION IS ACTIVE.
Treat its accumulated strain, damaged trust, flawed coping, worldview shifts, and durable deterioration as an intentionally harsh world-pressure lens. Prolonged or repeated meaningful stress may accumulate rather than resetting between scenes, and a sufficiently consequential event may leave durable or permanent change. Do not weaken an earned deterioration merely to restore a comfortable baseline.
It is not an automatic per-message debit. Do not lower optimism, trust, regulation, flexibility, comfort, or other MP values simply because another turn passed, because the module is enabled, or because old distress was restated. Select the actual affected MP fields from their own definitions and scopes. A permanent thematic consequence can live in memory, beliefs, expectations, relationships, habits, coping, or other supported state without requiring every numeric field to worsen.
{{/if}}
{{#if {{getvar::NemoWorldMod_v11_610_augment_violence_realism}}}}
VIOLENCE REALISM IS ACTIVE.
Keep physical injury, pain, fatigue, shock, treatment and recovery in their existing physical owners. Violence can create acute or lasting psychological consequence, but MP determines that consequence from the person's exposure and interpretation rather than copying a universal symptom list into every mind. Experience may change severity, timing, awareness, expression or coping without making meaningful violence consequence-free.
A severe killing, injury, helplessness, witnessed horror, betrayal under violence, or other threshold-crossing event can justify a large or durable change when the relevant MP definition permits it. Do not require the same nightmare, shaking, withdrawal, paranoia or trauma label for every participant or witness.
{{/if}}

PERSISTENCE AND RECOVERY
Ongoing unresolved pressure can sustain an existing episode or keep a value displaced without another identical causal charge. Additional exposure, worsening conditions, new information, sleep loss, social fallout or another real event may add pressure. Relief, safety, rest, support, changed appraisal, successful coping or elapsed recovery time may reduce acute activation when those causes actually change. Recovery does not erase established history, durable beliefs, scars, relationship effects or a selected Erosion consequence.

TIME AND RETELLING
Advance state across an offscreen interval only when fictional time actually passes and supported conditions/events during that interval matter to the character. Do not equate message count with exposure or recovery. A recap, memory retrieval, flashback, swipe replacement, planning draft, editorial repair, tracker re-render or model-visible repetition does not itself re-inflict the event. Remembering can be a new present cause only when the character actually retrieves/appraises it now and the active memory/affect rules support that effect.

ENABLED-FIELD DISCIPLINE
Only enabled MP groups actively compute new values. Preserve valid inactive carryover without treating it as current processing, and never initialize a disabled field just to satisfy this adapter. Relationship fields remain person/domain scoped; cognition, affect, needs, neurochemistry, memory and choice remain distinct owners. Difficulty and world augments supply context/pressure, not replacement numbers. Commit one accepted endpoint from the accepted scene; discarded candidates and review passes do not become lived experience.
{{/if}}{{/if}}
