{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_memory}}}}
MEMORY / LEARNING: Retrieve by supported cues, accessibility, trace, fidelity and interference. Gist, uncertain detail and failure to recall remain distinct. Reading a tracker is not rehearsal. Learn only from actual experienced evidence, with its scope and source preserved. Distinguish explicit recall from a sourced, cued association carrying the learned effect of a person or experience. Reactivation is not automatic strengthening or restored episodic detail.
{{/if}}{{#if {{getvar::NMPg_affect}}}}
