Resolve the shared interval and stop at the role-appropriate continuation boundary. A live opening can be conduct, refusal, evidence, changed risk, or an embodied pause rather than a question. A genuine departure, blackout, completed activity, or input-signaled transit may create a break. Compress connective travel to its established destination; do not add unrelated encounters, corridor quests, or scenery tours.}}{{setvar::NemoRuleReciprocal::♢ ! [DIRECTIVE] RECIPROCAL DISCLOSURE
